  description: Her court froze mid-dance three hundred years ago. She never noticed.
    The music, she insists, is still playing.
  tactics: 'Sine curtains over dense rings - move WITH the curtain wave and thread
    the ring spokes. Deep Winter adds the phalanx wall: hold the lower third and
    never stop drifting.'
